      },
      "lineNbr": 146,
      "author": {
        "id": 1043663
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-07-01T21:57:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Remove CREATION_DATETIME from this list.  We should require the caller always to provide the datetime.  Maybe find a place to document that the caller must do that.  Also, add a TODO to the VTS tests to add a test to enforce that the caller must provide it.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 145,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 146,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "ea9545e4ad315708e6249206ba93cb6735fa50b2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f81ccf62_f35849ea",
        "filename": "keymaster/aidl/android/hardware/keymaster/IKeymasterDevice.aidl",
        "patchSetId": 16
      },
      "lineNbr": 146,
      "author": {
        "id": 1589008
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-07-31T12:02:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "what tag should the caller put the datetime under?  I don\u0027t think we are doing this right now and I dont\u0027 see any appropate tags to put this under?  How about create a new tag called CURRENT_DATETIME and only allow as part of keyParameter input?",
      "parentUuid": "4ec8800b_726c8449",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 145,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 146,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "ea9545e4ad315708e6249206ba93cb6735fa50b2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d997182e_d6476a2a",
        "filename": "keymaster/aidl/android/hardware/keymaster/IKeymasterDevice.aidl",
        "patchSetId": 16
      },
      "lineNbr": 146,
      "author": {
        "id": 1043663
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-07-31T23:12:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "CREATION_DATETIME doesn\u0027t go in the TEE or STRONGBOX lists but it does need to go in the attestation, so Keystore should at minimum provide it when attestation is being done.  So we should have VTS tests to ensure that (a) if the CREATION_DATETIME isn\u0027t provided by the caller, it\u0027s not in the attestation cert and (b) if the CREATION_DATETIME is provided by the caller, it\u0027s in the attestation cert.  Then we should have a CTS test that verifies that it\u0027s in the attestation cert.  That way we\u0027ll have verified that the HAL never adds it and keystore always adds it.",
      "parentUuid": "f81ccf62_f35849ea",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 145,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 146,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "ea9545e4ad315708e6249206ba93cb6735fa50b2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ba5063fa_a19a51e2",
        "filename": "keymaster/aidl/android/hardware/keymaster/IKeymasterDevice.aidl",
        "patchSetId": 16
      },
      "lineNbr": 146,
      "author": {
        "id": 1589008
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-08-03T12:22:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I added this to the attestation certificate output description of generateKey and importKey.  if Keymint caller inputted the createion time in the attestation keyparameter, it will be added to certificate, otherwise it won\u0027t.  this is very straight forward and testable in vts.  I\u0027m not sure why you think it has to be, or only can be verified in cts?",
      "parentUuid": "d997182e_d6476a2a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 145,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 146,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "ea9545e4ad315708e6249206ba93cb6735fa50b2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d87b1f3f_52a9ca37",
        "filename": "keymaster/aidl/android/hardware/keymaster/IKeymasterDevice.aidl",
        "patchSetId": 16
      },
      "lineNbr": 146,
      "author": {
        "id": 1043663
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-08-04T22:40:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "VTS should verify the behavior of the HAL, that CREATION_DATETIME is only included if specified by the caller.\n\nCTS should verify the behavior of Keystore, that it always specifies CREATION_DATETIME.\n\nMake sense?",
      "parentUuid": "ba5063fa_a19a51e2",
